# Root .env.example
# The frontend (Vite/React) does NOT need Azure credentials — it communicates
# with the backend API only. All Azure config lives in backend/.env.
#
# See backend/.env.example for the full list of required environment variables.
#
# For local development:
#   1. cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
#   2. Edit backend/.env with your Azure resource values
#   3. Run `az login` for DefaultAzureCredential authentication
